theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 32
text = "- Updated the first sidescroller level to
make it feel more like a forest
- Updated the movement and animations of the cat
- When moving left or right
in the sidescroller, you now accelerate
- Jump height increases if you reach a high enough speed
- Implemented the changelog into the game
- Edited the credits to match the progress made
- You can now use the push action by pressing the
space bar (no push animation)
- By using push against a wall,
you can perform a wall push,
which gives you a burst of speed
- Using a wall push while pressing jump will allow you
to wall jump
"
horizontal_alignment = 1

